---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title={"Downward LUT6 Compilation in a Mixture of Limits Cascade"}
  description={"About: Downward LUT6 compilation in a four-rung Mixture of Limits cascade, Yosys/Verilator xck26 RTL simulation, Split-Conformal ACI gating, and AirMoL 4-bit NVMe streaming on 2026 hybrid models."}
>
  <section class="px-6 md:px-10 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label mb-4">Research study · draft · about</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-white tracking-tight">
      Downward LUT6 Compilation in a Mixture of Limits Cascade
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      This study reports the public reference at openIE-dev/lut-adapt-ai (commit a5e9bc1). It places a reconfigurable 6-input truth-table (LUT6) lookup tier ahead of Mamba-3 and 4-bit NVMe-streamed late-2026 hybrid and sparse-MoE models up to 34.66B parameters (LiquidAI/LFM3-1.7B, LiquidAI/LFM2.5-8B-A1B, and Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B), gates commits behind deterministic verifiers, and compiles certified wakes downward into 81-RAMB36E2 Beneš-routed lookup pages.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 glass-card p-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray mb-3">What the study claims and what it does not</p>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
        <li>Software and I/O measurements: exact Darwin F_NOCACHE os.pread NVMe byte counts (up to 12.30× NVMe reduction and 6.50× speedup in 2,530.7 MB = 3.83% FP16 RAM on Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B; 6.90× on LFM2.5-8B-A1B; 2.74× in 3.79% FP32 RAM on Oct 2026 LiquidAI/LFM3-1.7B), 100.0% lossless token parity, zero-MAC Sub1Bit-LUT6 equivalence to LittleBit-2 ITQ, and 43.75% verified pass rate with 0.00% broken commits admitted and 35,590× Wave-3 crystallized speedup on a 48-task late-2026 coding benchmark.</li>
        <li>RTL synthesis and cycle simulation: 41,186 xcup CLB LUTs (35.2% of xck26), 81 RAMB36E2 blocks (56.2%), and 0 DSP48 slices in Yosys 0.71+, with 1-cycle context switching (CPI = 1.0) in Verilator 5.054.</li>
        <li>Oracle-free wake gate: 0.00% false crystallization risk and 1.0000 OOD AUROC on the shifted test stream via a radially regularized JEPA-EBRM Split-Conformal + Adaptive Conformal Inference gate, keeping Conformal-bounded distinct from Deterministic.</li>
        <li>Not claimed: physical KV260 bitstream loading or isolated rail power in this repository (board_metered = false, measured_j = None), Vivado post-place-and-route 250 MHz timing closure, silicon energy leadership, or repository-scale SWE-bench evaluation beyond the 48-task deterministic contract benchmark.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <figure class="mt-10 glass-card p-4 fig-wide">
      <a class="fig-zoom" href="/figures/lut-adapt/mol-downward-cascade.svg" aria-label="Enlarge figure"><img src="/figures/lut-adapt/mol-downward-cascade.svg" alt="Four-rung Mixture of Limits cascade with downward SleepCrystallizer compilation into Beneš-routed LUT6 pages. Design diagram, not a power reading." class="fig-img w-full rounded bg-white" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></a>
      <figcaption class="mt-3 font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">Four-rung cascade and downward LUT6 crystallization loop. Design diagram, not a board power reading.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/papers/lut-adapt/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-dark bg-brand-amber px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-gold transition-colors">
        Read → /papers/lut-adapt/
      </a>
      <a href="/pdfs/lut-adapt.pdf" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-amber border border-brand-amber/40 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-amber/10 transition-colors" download>
        Download PDF
      </a>
      <a href="/living/lut-adapt/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-amber border border-brand-amber/40 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-amber/10 transition-colors">
        Interactive figures → /living/lut-adapt/
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/openIE-dev/lut-adapt-ai/tree/a5e9bc1de280f973bc9051b4cc58942820a67eeb" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-cyan border border-brand-cyan/40 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-cyan/10 transition-colors">
        Repository: openIE-dev/lut-adapt-ai
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate border border-brand-border px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:text-brand-white transition-colors">
        ← Catalog
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
